---
/**
 * Minimal funnel header: brand wordmark only, no navigation, no escape routes.
 * Used on /funnel/* sales + checkout pages to keep the page distraction-free
 * (classic landing-page CRO: remove every link away from the offer).
 * Same height/styling as the main Header so there is no layout shift.
 */
---

<header class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-black border-b border-gray-800" role="banner">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-4 flex items-center justify-center">
    <span class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-black uppercase text-white tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap select-none">
      Mikki Mase
    </span>
  </div>
</header>
